[itemtooltip]
// -- minerals, ores and bars --
skystonetip=Mineral - the pale stone every sky island is built out of. Mined from skystone outcrops.
aetheriumoretip=Ore - teal metal veined through Skyreach rock. Smelt it at a forge into Aetherium Bars.
aetheriumbartip=Metal bar - Aetherium ore smelted down. The Skyreach's everyday working metal.
stormshardtip=Mineral - a splinter struck off a storm crystal in the Stormveil, and still humming.
stormsteelbartip=Metal bar - Aetherium quenched in storm shard at an Aether Forge. The strongest metal up here.
stormglasstip=Mineral - fulgurite refired over skystone flux in a Stormglass Kiln, into a clear amber pane.
fulguritetip=Mineral - sand fused to glass where the lightning went into the Stormveil ground.
prismshardtip=Mineral - Prismabirch heartwood gone to crystal, prised out of the Aurora Shoals.
cinderpearltip=Mineral - an ember that forgot to go out, picked off the Ashen Reach. Burns green.
// -- fibres, cloth and flora --
windsilktip=Fibre - spun out of harvested Windwheat, or sheared off a Cloud Lamb.
skyweavetip=Cloth - a bolt of Windsilk woven on a Windsilk Loom by one of your settlers.
aurorapetaltip=Flower petal - picked off the aurora blooms of the Shoals, and still faintly lit.
// -- logs --
cloudwoodtip=Log - cut from a Cloud Tree in the Driftlands. Light enough to float, if you let it.
seraphwoodtip=Log - cut from a Sky Seraph along the Skyway Passages. Pale, straight and cold.
nimbuswoodtip=Log - cut from a Nimbus Willow in the Driftlands. Damp, grey and slow to burn.
charwoodtip=Log - cut from a Fulgur Pine in the Stormveil, charred through by old lightning.
prismwoodtip=Log - cut from a Prismabirch in the Aurora Shoals. The grain still throws colour.
// -- mob drops and livestock produce --
veilessencetip=Mob drop - what a Gloom Shade is made of. Cold to hold, colder to lose.
dewsnailtip=Critter - a Dew Snail, taken alive with a net. It carries a bead of sky dew on its shell.
aurorafleecetip=Livestock produce - fleece sheared off a Glimmergoat. Warm, and faintly lit in the dark.
nimbusmilktip=Food - drawn from a Nimbus Yak with a bucket. Drink it, or press it into Skycurd.
skycurdtip=Food - Nimbus Milk pressed in a cheese press. Keeps far longer than the milk did.
cloudcustardtip=Food - Nimbus Milk and cloudberries cooked in a pot. Quick on the feet afterwards.
nimbusdraughttip=Potion - Nimbus Milk brewed with an Aurora Petal. Thickens the skin against a long fall.
// -- odds and ends --
cloudpufftreattip=Pet treat - rolled from windsilk and petals. Siggi and Peanut will follow you for one.
silverbelltip=Quest key - the Warden's own bell. Ring it at a Seance Circle to open the way down into the Veil.
// -- the Stormsteel set and the three accessories --
stormsteelhelmettip=Head armour - Stormsteel plate with a stormglass visor. Beaten out at a Tungsten Anvil.
stormsteelchestplatetip=Chest armour - a Stormsteel cuirass with a storm-lens boss. Beaten out at a Tungsten Anvil.
stormsteelbootstip=Foot armour - Stormsteel greaves over a skyweave lining. Beaten out at a Tungsten Anvil.
stormsteelvambracetip=Accessory - a banded Stormsteel forearm guard, laced over skyweave.
auroralockettip=Accessory - an Aurora Petal sealed under stormglass on an aurora-fleece cord.
zephyrharnesstip=Accessory - a windsilk flight band strapped with storm down, buckled in Stormsteel.

